[I] GNS3 topology converter

[T] gns3-converter converts old ini-style GNS3 topologies (version 0.8.7 and
[T] older) to the newer JSON based topology format used by GNS3, the
[T] graphical network simulator.

[U] https://github.com/dlintott/gns3-converter

